  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "先接住关心",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "长辈让孩子多穿，是在表达担心。先接住心意，再按体感增减，大家都安心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sourceIndex": 1,
      "alt": "家人围绕孩子表达关心",
      "path": "E:\\JIMMY\\github\\blog-rebuild\\.recreate-work\\0910-171851-wechat\\cards\\image-001.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "给差异留余地",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "消费观不同，不必争辩。安排好自己的选择，也给家人留点体面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sourceIndex": 3,
      "alt": "在生活选择中给彼此留空间",
      "path": "E:\\JIMMY\\github\\blog-rebuild\\.recreate-work\\0910-171851-wechat\\cards\\image-002.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "柔软地守边界",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "顺而不从：先接住情绪，再守住边界。语气柔软，生活自己负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
